<title>FRANCE: FIGURE SKATING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the European figure</p>
<p>skating championships at Bercy on Saturday:</p>
<p>Women's final result:</p>
<p>1. Irina Slutskaya (Russia) 1.5 factored placements</p>
<p>2. Krisztina Czako (Hungary) 5.0</p>
<p>3. Yulia Lavrenchuk (Ukraine) 5.5</p>
<p>4. Maria Butyrskaya (Russia) 6.5</p>
<p>5. Elena Liashenko (Ukraine) 10.5</p>
<p>6. Vanessa Gusmeroli (France) 10.5</p>
<p>7. Eva-Maria Fitze (Germany) 12.0</p>
<p>8. Olga Markova (Russia) 13.0</p>
<p>9. Surya Bonaly (France) 13.0</p>
<p>10. Zuzanna Szwed (Poland) 14.0</p>
<p>11. Lenka Kulovana (Czech Republic) 14.0</p>
<p>12. Laetitia Hubert (France) 16.5</p>
<p>13. Anna Rechnio (Poland) 18.0</p>
<p>14. Yulia Vorobieva (Azerbaijan) 21.5</p>
<p>15. Anina Fivian (Switzerland) 22.5</p>
<p>16. Julia Lautova (Austria) 23.0</p>
<p>17. Veronika Dytrt (Germany) 23.5</p>
<p>18. Alisa Drei (Finland) 27.0</p>
<p>19. Mojca Kopac (Slovenia) 28.5</p>
<p>20. Diana Poth (Hungary) 30.0</p>
<p>21. Marta Andrade (Spain) 31.5</p>
<p>22. Tony-Sabrina Bombardieri (Italy) 32.0</p>
<p>23. Anna Dimova (Bulgaria) 35.0</p>
<p>24. Zuzanna Paurova (Slovakia) 35.5</p>
<p>Did not qualify for final: Sanna-Maija Wiksten (Finland),</p>
<p>Klara Bramfeldt (Sweden), Ivana Jakupcevic (Croatia), Jekaterina</p>
<p>Golovaten (Estonia), Jenna Arrowsmith (Britain) and Kaja</p>
<p>Hanevold (Norway).</p>
